== T3. the issue-bound model against the measured per-job quad rates (M cases a second a tile)
   bound = lanes x 108 M beats / instructions, one instruction a beat; the measured rate is the card run's median per job
   div32   bound  4.11   measured rne 2.022 (49% of the bound), best of four attributes 2.022 (49%)
   div64   bound  2.04   measured rne 1.538 (75% of the bound), best of four attributes 1.538 (75%)
   sqrt32  bound  4.65   measured rne 1.945 (42% of the bound), best of four attributes 2.238 (48%)
   sqrt64  bound  2.29   measured rne 1.521 (67% of the bound), best of four attributes 1.541 (67%)
CHECK no measured rate exceeds the issue bound (a model the data exceeds is wrong)                     ok 
CHECK CONTROL: a bound at a quarter of the documented beat rate lies below the measured rates (the check above can fail) ok 

