== T5. the composed items (rint, scaleb): the tile's share of a job, a pass's cost, and the staged traffic (quad, rne)
   a job is a batch of 4,096 operands; passes an operand: rint 2 calls x 4 (T2), scaleb the passes over the directed list (T2);
   tile time = beats / 108 M a second at lanes a beat; traffic of the four tiles = passes x words an element x element bytes, with 3 words (two read, one
   written: the lower figure, BELIEVED) or 4 (the engine streams all three operand buffers, docs/VALIDATION.md 2026-09-16 'one read enable feeds all three FIFOs', and a pass writes one),
   against the 2.3 to 3.3 GB/s of staged traffic that docs/VALIDATION.md 2026-09-08 measured whatever the format and the tile count
